        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 452,
          "value": "SECTION 1 — BECOME A RELIGIOUS PARTNER"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 454,
          "value": "Serve With Tradition. Grow With Trust."
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 457,
          "value": "The Religious Partner Network connects qualified Pandits, Purohits, Pandas, Acharyas, Vaidik Scholars, and traditional ritual specialists with seeking families across India and worldwide.\r\n          "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 463,
          "value": "Who the Network is For"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 465,
          "value": "Qualified ritual practitioners, tradition-guided priests, traditional Panda record custodians, and Vaidik scholars dedicated to sacred service, authentic mantras, and ceremonial integrity.\r\n              "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 469,
          "value": "Role in Ritual Delivery"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 471,
          "value": "Religious Partners conduct authentic Vaidik rites for seeking families while Connect Hub Co. manages scheduling, client communication, travel logistics, and administrative support.\r\n              "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 475,
          "value": "Core Pillars of Service"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 477,
          "value": "We uphold the importance of traditional Vaidik Vidhi, demonstrated competence, punctuality, respectful conduct, and clear, compassionate communication with every family.\r\n              "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 481,
          "value": "Application & Verification Standard"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 483,
          "value": "Submitting registration details constitutes an initial application. Final onboarding requires human review, background check, and document verification. No automatic approval or customer assignments are guaranteed.\r\n              "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 488,
          "value": "Transparent Application Standard"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 490,
          "value": "Registration is an initial application and review process. Network membership and service assignments depend on verified credentials, location feasibility, and adherence to approved ethical standards. No approval or customer assignment is promised prior to verification.\r\n            "
        },
